# Clause 6: Planning

## Overview
Clause 6 establishes requirements for planning and addressing information security risks and objectives.

## Gaps in this Clause

| Gap | Title | Risk | Status |
|-----|-------|------|--------|
| GAP-004 | Risk Assessment | HIGH | Not Implemented |
| GAP-005 | Security Objectives | MEDIUM | Not Implemented |

## Key Requirements

- Conduct systematic risk assessments
- Identify, analyze, and evaluate information security risks
- Define measurable information security objectives
- Communicate objectives throughout the department

## Remediation Priority

**CRITICAL** — Risk assessment is foundational. Without it, the Finance Department cannot identify what needs to be protected or prioritize efforts.
